{"id": "EUVD-2026-95885", "enisaUuid": "e43a22d5-cdc8-3a9a-8305-961adf5e9f8d", "description": "ruoyi-ai 3.0.0 through 3.1.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to delete other users' workflows via POST /workflow/del/{uuid}. Attackers can obtain workflow UUIDs from GET /workflow/search and supply them because softDelete() skips the PrivilegeUtil.checkAndGetByUuid() ownership check, removing owners' workflows.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T15:04:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:04:26", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/cve-2026-108111-108112-ruoyi-ai-workflow-authz", "https://github.com/ageerle/ruoyi-ai/blob/v3.1.0/ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-aiflow/src/main/java/org/ruoyi/workflow/service/WorkflowService.java#L204-L207", "https://github.com/ageerle/ruoyi-ai/blob/v3.1.0/ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-aiflow/src/main/java/org/ruoyi/workflow/controller/WorkflowController.java#L55-L59", "https://github.com/ageerle/ruoyi-ai", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ruoyi-ai-3.0.0-through-3.1.0-missing-authorization-via-workflow-delete-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h7qx-c58p-3mff", "CVE-2026-108112"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4fe23ff0-3860-36d8-b825-871530e44010", "product": {"name": "ruoyi-ai", "vendor": {"name": "ageerle"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 \u22643.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b017a134-0128-3def-a9d1-85af97a3bf8d", "vendor": {"name": "ageerle"}}], "isExploited": false}